{"id":"599700e7a62f585a","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-low-strict.md","title":"Low 层级严格递增","display":"thm-low-strict — Low 层级严格递增","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-low-strict","aliases":["20-thm-low-strict"],"display":"thm-low-strict — Low 层级严格递增","chapter":"4","section":"4.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-proof-pending","source_reference":"§4.4.2 的严格递增陈述","source_pdf_pages":[129],"source_printed_pages":[93],"depends_on":["[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-low-strict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-low-strict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low-strict — Low 层级严格递增"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-proof-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§4.4.2 的严格递增陈述"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>129</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_n\">\\(L_n\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_2\">\\(D_2\\)</span> 中定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 source-statement-proof-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\nL_n\\subsetneq L_{n+1},\\qquad\nL_n\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\subsetneq L_{n+1}\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\nL_n\\subsetneq L_{n+1},\\qquad\nL_n\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\subsetneq L_{n+1}\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含由跳跃单调性给出；严格性及 c.e. 限制在原书 §4.4.2 明确陈述，但本章未给出完整构造。本原子保留已核实的结果，标注构造证明待补，不借包含证明冒充严格性证明。</p>\n<p>来源：§4.4.2 的严格递增陈述；印刷页 93；PDF 第 129 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anc